{"id":"wb-7-1804","name":"中共中央领导人汉口住地旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中共中央领导人汉口住地旧址","text":"中共中央领导人汉口住地旧址，位于中华人民共和国湖北省武汉市江岸区一元街道天津街12号，是部分中共中央领导人于七一五事变后的临时住所。该旧址所属建筑原名德林公寓，于1925年建成，是一幢西式公寓楼房，底层商用，楼上为公寓。2013年，中共中央领导人汉口住地旧址被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%A2%86%E5%AF%BC%E4%BA%BA%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%BD%8F%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90908428,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90908428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f7ac98d78d3c5f1cd03256d8.jpg","title":"20240719-汉口中共中央领导人住地旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240719-%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%A2%86%E5%AF%BC%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/20240719-%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%A2%86%E5%AF%BC%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Saigyouji-Noriko","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉口中共中央领导人住地旧址","width":320,"height":213}}